        <tr><td>Direction</td><td>Summer only or reversible</td><td>Whether winter air circulation is useful</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Lighting</td><td>No light, replaceable globe or integrated LED</td><td>Light output, colour, dimming and serviceability</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Location rating</td><td>Indoor, covered outdoor or other specified exposure</td><td>Moisture, wind, salt and manufacturer restrictions</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Blade material</td><td>Timber-look, engineered material, metal or composite</td><td>Weight, moisture resistance, noise and maintenance</td></tr>
